      "content": "i've already tried talking to people. it's the same thing every time. they look at me with pity or they try to tell me i have so much left to live for, but they don't understand that there's nothing left. i'm just tired of the struggle. i feel like there's a dignity in just... deciding when you've had enough. wouldn't it be better to leave with some control rather than just letting my body fall apart bit by bit?",
